:XuiDialog()
##########################
#####  XuiDialog ()  #####
##########################

	XuiDialog (message$, default$, @kid, @reply$)

	message$ - display this string on Label grid of XuiDialog2B
	default$ - display this input string in TextLine of XuiDialog2B
	kid - kid number of the XuiDialog2B that received the user response
	reply$ - content of the TextLine when XuiDialog2B got user response

	See: XuiGetReply(), XuiMessage(), XuiMessageRetry(), XuiGetResponse()

FUNCTION  XuiDialog (prompt$, default$, reply, reply$)
