:XuiEditCopy()
############################
#####  XuiEditCopy ()  #####
############################

	XuiEditCopy (bufferNumber)

	Copies the selected text into the
	clipboard text buffer

	The same as Ctrl+C or Ctrl+Insert

FUNCTION  XuiEditCopy (bufferNumber)
:XuiEditCut()
###########################
#####  XuiEditCut ()  #####
###########################

	XuiEditCut (bufferNumber)

	Copies the selected text into the
	clipboard text buffer, and
	deletes the selected text.

	The same as Ctrl-X

FUNCTION  XuiEditCut (bufferNumber)
:XuiEditPaste()
#############################
#####  XuiEditPaste ()  #####
#############################

	XuiEditPaste (pasteGrid, bufferNumber)

	Copies text from the clipboard text buffer,
	and puts it into the pasteGrid text at
	the curent cursor position.

	If the pasteGrid has selected text,
	it is replaced with buffer text.

	If no pasteGrid is specified, the text is
	pasted into the grid with keyboard focus.

	Ctrl+V or
	Shift+ Insert
	       will paste the default buffer text
	       into the grid with keyboard focus.

FUNCTION  XuiEditPaste (pasteGrid, bufferNumber)
