:XuiGetReply()
############################
#####  XuiGetReply ()  #####
############################

	XuiGetReply (grid, title$, message$, grids$, @v0, @v1, @kid, @reply$)

	grid - grid number of an existing grid
	title$ - display this string on the window title bar
	message$ - display this string on the first kid that is a Label grid
	grids$ - display these strings on the grids following the Label grid
	v0, v1 - copies of the v0, v1 arguments returned by the gridTypes$ grid
	kid - kid number in gridTypes$ that receive user response
	reply$ - contents of textString or textArray as defined in gridTypes$

	See: XuiDialog(), XuiGetResponse(), XuiMessage(), XuiMessageRetry()

FUNCTION  XuiGetReply (grid, title$, prompt$, grids$, v0, v1, reply, reply$)
:XuiGetResponse()
###############################
#####  XuiGetResponse ()  #####
###############################

	XuiGetResponse (gridTypeName$, title$, message$, grids$, @v0, @v1, @kid, @reply$)

	gridTypeName$ - grid type name (like "XuiDialog3B")
	title$ - display this string on the window title bar
	message$ - display this string on the first kid that is a Label grid
	grids$ - display these strings on the kid grids following the Label grid
	v0, v1 - copies of the v0, v1 arguments returned by the gridTypeName$ grid
	kid - kid number of the gridTypeName$ that received the user response
	reply$ - contents of the textString$ or textArray$ as defined in gridTypeName$

	See: XuiDialog(), XuiGetReply(), XuiMessage(), XuiMessageRetry()

FUNCTION  XuiGetResponse (gridType$, title$, prompt$, grids$, v0, v1, reply, reply$)
