#####  XuiGetValue ()  #####
############################

	XuiGetValue (grid, #GetValue, @v0, @v1, @v2, @v3, kid, index)

	Fetches four consecutive values from a grid value array.

	grid,kid = target grid for the value array
	index    = index to the first of 4 values to get
	v0       = value at index
	v1       = value at index + 1
	v2       = value at index + 2
	v3       = value at index + 3

	See: GetValue, GetValues

