	XuiMessage (message$)

	By default the message text is aligned to the center of the message window.
	The text can be aligned left by following the "[" with a "<" in the title:
	message$ = "[<Window Title]\n main message"

	See: XuiDialog(), XuiGetReply(), XuiMessageRetry(), XuiGetResponse()

