	retry is returned $$TRUE if the "Retry" is pushed
	                 $$FALSE if the "Cancel" is pushed

	@retry$ will have the string name of the button pressed

	See: XuiGetReply(), XuiDialog(), XuiMessage(), XuiGetResponse()

