###############################
#####  XuiPlaceWindow ()  #####
###############################

	XuiPlaceWindow (window, windowType, @xDisp, @yDisp, @width, @height)

	XuiPlaceWindow adjusts the position and size of a window
	to fit within the screen work area making allowance for
	the border width and title height.

	If the given window type is of type $$WindowTypeNoFrame,
	it is allowed to fill the entire screen work area.

FUNCTION  XuiPlaceWindow (window, windowType, xDisp, yDisp, width, height)
