:XuiPressButton()
###############################
#####  XuiPressButton ()  #####
###############################

	XuiPressButton (@grid, #Create, x, y, width, height, window, parent)

	XuiPressButton will generate a #Selection message when
	the button is pushed (mouseDown) and,
	if held down for 4 time intervals,
	will be repeated at the interval in the #SetTimer message

		XuiSendMessage ( grid, #SetTimer, msec, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0)

		XuiSendMessage ( grid, #SetStyle, style, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0)

	style can be:
	$$TriangleUp
	$$TriangleRight
	$$TriangleDown
	$$TriangleLeft

	Used by XuiRange(), XuiDropBox(), XuiListButton(), XuiScrollBarH()

	See: XuiPushButton(), XuiToggleButton(), XuiRadioButton(), Create, CreateWindow

FUNCTION  XuiPressButton (grid, message, v0, v1, v2, v3, r0, (r1, r1$, r1[], r1$[]))
