##################################

		return = XuiProcessMessage (grid, message, v0, v1, v2, v3, kid, r1, gridType)

		return = kid number if able to call a valid kid grid function
	return = $$XuiError if invalid argument detected

		Does not process "Create" or "CreateWindow" message


